                </article>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"mt-5 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 rounded-lg border border-[#E5D9AE] bg-[#FBF7E9] px-4 py-3.5 text-[14px] text-[#483D1C]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-3\" data-name=\"load error alert banner\" role=\"alert\">\n                    <p data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-3-1\" data-name=\"error alert message\">\n                        <span class=\"font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-3-1-1\" data-name=\"error headline text\">\n                            More listings couldn’t be loaded.\n                        </span>\n                        The 4 vehicles above remain available to browse.\n                    </p>\n                    <button class=\"inline-flex min-h-9 items-center gap-2 rounded-md px-3 font-bold text-[#0B5D3B] hover:bg-white/70\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-3-2\" data-name=\"retry button\" type=\"button\">\n                        <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon-rotate-cw text-[15px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-3-2-1\" data-name=\"rotate/cw reload icon\">\n                        </i>\n                        Retry\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n    </main>\n</div>\n",
